 ## Operating characteristics
 *   **Time Complexity:** Training time with context models is approximately 1.3× longer than without context models [S1].
-*   **Memory Complexity:** The method significantly reduces storage size. On the Synthetic-NeRF dataset, CNC achieves a size reduction of 100× with improved fidelity against the baseline Instant-NGP [S1]. On the Tanks and Temples dataset, it achieves a 70× reduction with improved fidelity [S1].
